; One prop the service owns: a cube, drawn where the last slice said it was.
;
; No collision shape and no RigidBody. The service simulates; this draws. A physics body here
; would be a second simulation disagreeing with the authoritative one every frame, which is
; exactly the divergence a server-authoritative design exists to remove.
